oration-2 hover:underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"1. The service\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [\u0026_a]:font-medium [\u0026_a]:underline [\u0026_a]:decoration-orange-accent [\u0026_a]:decoration-2 [\u0026_a]:underline-offset-4 [\u0026_li]:ml-5 [\u0026_li]:list-disc [\u0026_li]:pl-1 [\u0026_strong]:text-obsidian [\u0026_ul]:space-y-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Captionit\",\" turns your videos into captioned videos and subtitle files. You upload a video, captions are transcribed, you style and edit them in the studio, and you export the result.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Transcription and MP4 export run \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"in your browser\"}],\", on your own device. Transparent overlay exports use the optional free desktop Companion app on your computer. Your projects and exports are stored with our hosting providers (see the \",[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/subprocessors\",\"children\":\"subprocessors\"}],\"); your video files stay on your device — only their file name, size, length and format are stored with your project — except one you send to a Companion export.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We improve the service continuously, so features may change. We will tell you in advance before removing a core feature.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"accounts\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#accounts\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"2. Your account\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [\u0026_a]:font-medium [\u0026_a]:underline [\u0026_a]:decoration-orange-accent [\u0026_a]:decoration-2 [\u0026_a]:underline-offset-4 [\u0026_li]:ml-5 [\u0026_l